@startuml
title Update Immutable Data Record - Activity Diagram

start
:Receive request (record ID, updated data);
:Retrieve existing record;
if (Record Exists?) then (yes)
  :Validate updated data against schema;
  if (Data Valid?) then (yes)
    :Create new record version;
    :Store new version in database;
    :Return new version ID;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Return error message (invalid data);
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Return error message (record not found);
  stop
endif

@enduml